cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "voro-gis-qa: quality checks for GIS data, tested against injected errors"
abstract: >-
  Quality checks for the official boundaries of Polish municipalities (PRG and TERC):
  a golden dataset, seven checks (geometry, TERYT codes, county nesting, coordinate
  system, overlaps and gaps, names, state border), controlled error injection with a log
  of every error, evaluation against that log, findings grouped into incidents, and a QA
  report in Markdown and HTML.
type: software
authors:
